      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 正弦信号的三个参数\n\n$$x(t) = A \\sin(2 \\pi f t + \\phi)$$\n\n- `A`：振幅（Amplitude）\n- `f`：频率（Frequency），单位 Hz\n- `T = 1 / f`：周期（Period），单位 s\n- `omega = 2 pi f`：角频率（Angular frequency），单位 rad/s\n- `phi`：初相位（Phase）\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellInsert",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec2_setup",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "JupyterLabCellSelect",
      "path": "lesson.ipynb",
      "cell_id": "cynapse_sec2_setup",
